{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51738","headline":"题天坛 · 杜光庭","name":"题天坛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"壁立三千仞，坛高接尾箕。\n顶藏青玉髓，腰隐紫金芝。\n月挂虚皇殿，云封太乙池。\n洞天人迹少，鹤宿万年枝。\n（《古今图书集成·山川典》四六《王屋山部》）（〖1〗《正统道藏》本杜光庭《天坛王屋山圣迹记》收此诗於通真道人名下。\n通真道人生平未详。\n乾隆《济源县志》卷十六作姚合诗。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51738.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51738","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}